### 2. `guardians` (`src/modules/guardians/`)
1. **Purpose:** Manages user guardian relationships, invitations, priorities, and accept/reject flows.
2. **APIs/Routes:** `POST /api/v1/guardians`, `GET /api/v1/guardians`, `PATCH /api/v1/guardians/:id`, `DELETE /api/v1/guardians/:id`, `POST /api/v1/guardians/:id/accept`, `POST /api/v1/guardians/:id/reject`.
3. **Models Used:** [Guardian](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/modules/guardians/guardian.service.js#69-77) (`guardians` collection), [User](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/tests/guardian.endpoint.test.js#46-48).
4. **Utilities Used:** [ApiError](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/utils/ApiError.js#1-35), [asyncHandler](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/utils/asyncHandler.js#1-3), `response`, [emitToUserRoom](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/sockets/index.js#28-54).
5. **External Services Used:** None.
6. **Socket.IO Events Emitted:** `guardian:request`, `guardian:accepted`, `guardian:rejected`. Listens to: None.
7. **Internal Events:** None.
8. **Modules Imported:** `calling` (reuses [findUserById](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/tests/call.service.test.js#1632-1638) helper).
9. **Modules Depending on It:** `sos` (queries active guardians for escalation level 1).
10. **Internal Functionality:** Atomic state changes (PENDING → ACTIVE / REJECTED / BLOCKED), priority sorting.
11. **Duplicated Functionality:** None.
12. **Imports/Exports Status:** Intact ES modules.
13. **Environment Variables:** None specific.
14. **npm Dependencies:** `mongoose`, `express`, `zod`.
15. **Assumptions About Other Modules:** Assumes [User](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/tests/guardian.endpoint.test.js#46-48) collection contains valid guardian target profiles.

