### 6. `ride` (`src/modules/ride/`)
1. **Purpose:** Manages ride lifecycle from screenshot upload (Cloudinary + OCR + AI prefill) to route calculation and monitoring.
2. **APIs/Routes:** `POST /api/v1/rides/upload`, `GET /api/v1/rides`, `GET /api/v1/rides/:id`, `POST /api/v1/rides/:id/confirm`, `POST /api/v1/rides/:id/start`, `POST /api/v1/rides/:id/stop`.
3. **Models Used:** [Ride](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/modules/ride/ride.service.js#38-43) (`rides` collection).
4. **Utilities Used:** `geo` ([haversineMeters](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/utils/geo.js#24-34)), `logger`, [socket.js](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/sockets/socket.js) helpers (`emitToRide`, [emitToUser](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/sockets/authSocket.js#44-48)).
5. **External Services Used:** Google Maps API (Directions/Geocoding), Cloudinary, Tesseract.js (OCR), Groq AI.
6. **Socket.IO Events Emitted:** `ride:started`, `ride:updated`, `ride:offRoute`, `ride:longStop`.
7. **Internal Events:** Emits `OFF_ROUTE` and `LONG_STOP` onto `safetyEventBus`.
8. **Modules Imported:** `googleMaps`, `safetySession.service`, [socket.js](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/sockets/socket.js).
9. **Modules Depending on It:** `monitoring`, `location`.
10. **Internal Functionality:** Synthetic straight-line fallback routes if Google Maps is disabled.
11. **Duplicated Functionality:** Socket helper usages differ between Person 1's [emitToUserRoom](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/sockets/index.js#28-54) and Person 2's `src/socket/socket.js`.
12. **Imports/Exports Status:** Intact ES modules.
13. **Environment Variables:** `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`, `CLOUDINARY_*`, `GROQ_API_KEY`.
14. **npm Dependencies:** `mongoose`, `express`.
15. **Assumptions About Other Modules:** Assumes `safetySession` exists to attach ride.

