### 8. `voice` (`src/modules/voice/`)
1. **Purpose:** Voice threat classification (STT text → threat score 0–100) and audio recording upload/streaming.
2. **APIs/Routes:** `POST /api/v1/voice/analyze`, `POST /api/v1/voice/recordings`, `GET /api/v1/voice/recordings`, `GET /api/v1/voice/recordings/:recordingId/audio`.
