4. **Utilities Used:** `translate.middleware`, `upload.middleware`.
5. **External Services Used:** Groq API (threat classification), Gemini API (translation), Cloudinary.
6. **Socket.IO Events Emitted:** None.
7. **Internal Events:** None.
8. **Modules Imported:** `groqThreat.service`, `cloudinary.service`, `geminiTranslate.service`.
9. **Modules Depending on It:** None.
10. **Internal Functionality:** 50-point threat threshold calculation (`sosTriggered = threatLevel > 50`).
11. **Duplicated Functionality:** **CRITICAL SCRIPT CONFLICT:** Written in CommonJS ([require](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/middleware/auth.js#16-38)/`module.exports`) inside an ES Module project (`"type": "module"` in [package.json](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/package.json)).
12. **Imports/Exports Status:** ❌ **BROKEN**: Using [require()](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/middleware/auth.js#16-38) and `module.exports` will crash Node ESM runtime on import.
13. **Environment Variables:** `GROQ_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `CLOUDINARY_*`.
14. **npm Dependencies:** `multer`, `cloudinary`, `mongoose`, `express`.
15. **Assumptions About Other Modules:** Assumes client manually calls SOS endpoint if `sosTriggered` is true (does NOT call Person 1's [sos.service.js](file:///d:/kolkata%20hackathon/Backend/src/modules/sos/sos.service.js)).

